## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s ConsoleHudCustomizer|r 1.27.15
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Moves and resizes the health, magicka and stamina bars and the skill bar on the HUD. Each one is placed on its own -- sideways from the middle of the screen and up from the bottom edge -- and scaled from half size to double, frame, numbers and all. The skill bar also gets a row for the weapon set you are not on, and both sets can show how long is left on each ability's effect and how many targets are under it, at a text size of your choosing.
## Version: 1.27.15
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsConsoleHudCustomizer_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Controls.xml

Main.lua
SkillBar.lua
Timers.lua
Trace.lua
Plain.lua
ReturnTrace.lua
Preview.lua
Settings.lua

